<title>USA: Dole Food to repurchase common shares.</title>
<headline>Dole Food to repurchase common shares.</headline>
<dateline>WESTLAKE VILLAGE, Calif. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dole Food Co Inc said Wednesday it has approved a program to repurchase up to five percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>On October 8 Dole had 60,177,454 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>&quot;The board believes that Dole's shares are from time to time undervalued by the market,&quot; said David Murdock, chief executive officer of Dole.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe that our stock is a good investment at recent market prices and that purchases by the company will enhance the potential for growth in earnings per share of the Dole shares that remain outstanding,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
